CCPE means Combined Credential- and Platform-Bound Enforcement. In its S2 architecture, two structurally separate artifacts remain load-bearing: the principal-rooted mandate and the platform credential or capability. Decisions are reconciled without enlarging authority; platform denial cannot be overridden by a mandate. The relevant profile governs evaluation order and its exact requirements.

